      "id": "seg:code:declaration:0006:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nfunc setTransformRamp(fromStart startTransform: CGAffineTransform, toEnd endTransform: CGAffineTransform, timeRange: CMTimeRange)\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nfunc setTransformRamp(fromStart startTransform: CGAffineTransform, toEnd endTransform: CGAffineTransform, timeRange: CMTimeRange)\n```",
