      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "During a transform ramp, the affine transform is interpolated between the values set at the ramp’s start time and end time.",
      "ko": "This method plays the available media data at the specified `rate` regardless of whether there is sufficient media buffered to ensure smooth playback.",
      "sourceHash": "c4b735d399330c28215d001cfbbb84112f60dabe757b0a98c3ca46bfeddf5cc5",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "Before the first specified time for which a transform is set, the affine transform is held constant at the value of [`CGAffineTransformIdentity`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreGraphics/CGAffineTransformIdentity); after the last time for which a transform is set, the affine transform is held constant at that last value.",
      "ko": "If media data exists in the playback buffer, calling this method changes the player’s playback rate to the specified `rate` and its [`timeControlStatus`](avplayer/timecontrolstatus-swift.property.md) to a value of [`AVPlayer.TimeControlStatus.playing`](avplayer/timecontrolstatus-swift.enum/playing.md).",
      "sourceHash": "bd843ade49b357f5d19d704a9eb5ce9502f2a85d038e6d29d2f24be5ba40f4db",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:heading:parameters:0009:0001",
      "source": "Parameters",
      "ko": "Parameters",
      "sourceHash": "e68b36b17cbd990802f57741cb75cf3a73fa66a61999b0cd70e3cf7d26cfb25f",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0010:0001",
      "source": "`startTransform`: The transform to be applied at the starting time of `timeRange`.",
      "ko": "`rate`: The specified playback rate.",
      "sourceHash": "3c53c77eca7318e3a82adba0fd556caf53acec15af1ba0eddd3bdde24d5cc757",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0010:0002",
      "source": "`endTransform`: The transform to be applied at the end time of `timeRange`.",
      "ko": "`endTransform`: `timeRange`의 종료 시점에 적용할 transform입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "525e8572f82d159f0185bf64d3e7575599a408ae950071fe05e2defbcf932834",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0010:0003",
      "source": "`timeRange`: The time range over which the value of the transform is interpolated between `startTransform` and `endTransform`.",
      "ko": "`timeRange`: transform 값이 `startTransform`과 `endTransform` 사이에서 보간되는 시간 범위입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "e8f23d8e90cbf447c1689a37ad5788ade68256a4b4dce4fe6dab40d063d5dfd4",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
